  <div class="mo mo-d3" style="margin-top:48px"><p class="s-num gn">SciAgent: Inputs → Patterns → Protocols</p><p style="font-size:.88rem;margin:12px 0 24px;line-height:2">SciAgent correlates patterns like CRP spikes with poor sleep, dietary errors, or missed rinses and writes simple daily orders: what to rinse, swallow, and avoid—today.</p><div class="pipe"><div class="pi"><h4>Inputs</h4><p>Labs, wearables, oral photographs, clinical notes.</p></div><span class="pa">→</span><div class="pi"><h4>Patterns</h4><p>Multi‑week correlations, threshold crossings, response curves.</p></div><span class="pa">→</span><div class="pi"><h4>Protocols</h4><p>A living checklist for today, this week, this quarter.</p></div></div></div>
